      "safe_claims": [
        "Waterproofing protects surfaces from destructive water effects.",
        "Membrane waterproofing is recommended where direct rain or standing water is expected.",
        "Fluid-applied elastomeric waterproofing can be monolithic, seamless, flexible, and elastic over a wide temperature range.",
        "Rustproofing protects ferrous materials such as steel and iron from rusting or corrosion.",
        "Painting and coating work depends on manufacturer-recommended materials and clean, prepared surfaces."
